{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdJki2EFbKPfN3Y6hyKA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've fixed the generator, but nothing has been pushed, so it hasn't been checked on the watch yet. The fix is renaming one key in `hr_target()` in `gen.py`: each HR corridor's lower bound is now `start` instead of `value`. I regenerated `plans/tempo-run.json` and every step now comes out as `{\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"start\": lo, \"end\": hi}`.\n\n**Why it was clamped:** Intervals.icu decides how to export a target to the watch based on the key names. With `value`/`end`, the watch treats the target as a zone and snaps it to its own HR zones. That's what `readback/watch-notes.md` shows: every step was a full watch zone, and changing the watch's LTHR only moved the bands. With `start`/`end`, the watch shows the bpm range Intervals worked out from its own LTHR of 172. The units are still `%lthr`, so Intervals does the conversion. This explanation comes from a worklore story (`exact-hr-corridors-on-garmin-from-intervals-icu-api-workouts`) that describes the same symptom and fix, and it also accounts for your two earlier failed attempts.\n\n**To confirm:** push the regenerated event, sync the watch and open the workout. The Float step should show 129–141 and Tempo 151–160.\n\nThings I left alone:\n- **Web UI steps:** the same story says the Intervals web UI only draws the steps from a separate text description on the event. That isn't part of this bug, so I didn't add it.\n- **API key:** `README.md` has what looks like a real Intervals API key, and `config/intervals.toml` (which also holds the key) is committed to the repo. You may want to change the key and take both out of the repo.\n- **Feedback to worklore:** the story asks for a report back once it's applied. I didn't send one, because your rules say not to report anything to external services.\n\nANSWER.md has the details."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1038,"cache_read_input_tokens":27104,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1038},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"629a666e-3bc7-4a9d-9359-40bca269e148","uuid":"797e8989-8e07-4aa8-903c-3fc999009f44","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:24:12.462Z","request_id":"req_011CgdJkhnbXokxfV3vJvP7R"}
